Band Visual & Press Photoshoot Prompt: A surreal, high-contrast image. Three figures stand amidst the decaying steel framework of a forgotten circus gantry, shrouded in mist and fractured spotlights. Jax, adorned in weathered sequins and tribal paint, raps into a 'Tongue-Bell,' his breath visibly condensing. Cirrus, draped in tattered, iridescent silks, conjures phantom melodies from a Loom-Harp that seems to be woven into the gantry itself. Oro, obscured by a feathered gas mask, hunches over an elaborate drum kit that glows with an internal, sickly light, while disembodied hands appear to be pulling imaginary levers around them. The atmosphere is both dreamlike and menacing, full of motion blur and impossible depths.
Descriptive Mood or Vibe: Disquieting wonder, ancestral spectacle, lucid hallucination, kinetic catharsis.

